VALUES ('lolxqdumukx6218skuwkj1qj', 'CCI-000630', $body$The organization requires in acquisition documents, that information system components are delivered in a secure, documented configuration, and that the secure configuration is the default configuration for any software reinstalls or upgrades.$body$, 'SA-4', 'SA-4 (5)', NULL, NOW(), NOW())
