VALUES ('srme82qnuwu6nsyicj3s7ep7', 'CCI-000635', $body$The organization requires, if no NIAP-approved Protection Profile exists for a specific technology type but a commercially provided information technology product relies on cryptographic functionality to enforce its security policy, that the cryptographic module is FIPS-validated.$body$, 'SA-4', 'SA-4 (7) (b)', NULL, NOW(), NOW())
