VALUES ('wcrbfv0ucqvm0jgwiknbbw5x', 'CCI-000895', $body$The organization requires that, prior to initiating maintenance or diagnostic activities by personnel who do not have needed access authorizations, clearances or formal access approvals, all volatile information storage components within the information system be sanitized and all nonvolatile storage media be removed or physically disconnected from the system and secured.$body$, 'MA-5', 'MA-5 (1) (b)', NULL, NOW(), NOW())
